{"page":239,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"232","words":[{"text":"232","x":191,"y":132,"width":74,"height":33}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":569,"y":144,"width":128,"height":24},{"text":"03","x":708,"y":144,"width":34,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":776,"y":150,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":819,"y":143,"width":133,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":964,"y":143,"width":53,"height":29}]},{"text":"때문에 억제될 수 있다. 즉, 송신자 제어의 이 형태는 혼잡제어(congestion control)로","words":[{"text":"때문에","x":544,"y":266,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"억제될","x":663,"y":267,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":777,"y":268,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":827,"y":267,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"즉,","x":916,"y":269,"width":43,"height":34},{"text":"송신자","x":974,"y":269,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"제어의","x":1086,"y":266,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1205,"y":266,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"형태는","x":1253,"y":266,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡제어(congestion","x":1368,"y":263,"width":333,"height":40},{"text":"control)로","x":1714,"y":270,"width":161,"height":35}]},{"text":"알려져 있다. 3.6절과3.7절에서 이 억제를 세부적으로 살펴볼 것이다. 흐름제어와 혼","words":[{"text":"알려져","x":544,"y":325,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":663,"y":326,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"3.6절과3.7절에서","x":754,"y":325,"width":281,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1054,"y":325,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"억제를","x":1105,"y":325,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"세부적으로","x":1221,"y":325,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"살펴볼","x":1410,"y":323,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1530,"y":323,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"흐름제어와","x":1660,"y":324,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"혼","x":1846,"y":331,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"잡제어에서 수행되는 동작들이 비슷하지만(송신자의 억제), 흐름제어와 혼잡제어는 명","words":[{"text":"잡제어에서","x":544,"y":383,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"수행되는","x":728,"y":384,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"동작들이","x":878,"y":384,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"비슷하지만(송신자의","x":1029,"y":384,"width":321,"height":38},{"text":"억제),","x":1369,"y":383,"width":88,"height":38},{"text":"흐름제어와","x":1473,"y":383,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡제어는","x":1660,"y":384,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"명","x":1847,"y":392,"width":24,"height":36}]},{"text":"백히 서로 다른 목적을 위해서 수행된다. 불행히도 많은 저자들은 용어를 혼용해서 사","words":[{"text":"백히","x":545,"y":443,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"서로","x":626,"y":444,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":708,"y":443,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"목적을","x":789,"y":443,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"위해서","x":907,"y":442,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"수행된다.","x":1022,"y":442,"width":146,"height":38},{"text":"불행히도","x":1184,"y":442,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1338,"y":443,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"저자들은","x":1422,"y":443,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"용어를","x":1575,"y":443,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"혼용해서","x":1695,"y":444,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"사","x":1845,"y":451,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"용하며, 여러분은 두 경우를 잘 구분하기 바란다. 이제 TCP가 흐름제어 서비스를 어떻","words":[{"text":"용하며,","x":543,"y":502,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"여러분은","x":669,"y":502,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":817,"y":504,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"경우를","x":866,"y":502,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"잘","x":978,"y":502,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"구분하기","x":1025,"y":501,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"바란다.","x":1177,"y":502,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"이제","x":1304,"y":502,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"TCP가","x":1384,"y":503,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"흐름제어","x":1507,"y":503,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"서비스를","x":1662,"y":504,"width":139,"height":36},{"text":"어떻","x":1814,"y":507,"width":56,"height":41}]},{"text":"게 제공하는지 살펴보자. 전체 내용을 살펴보기 위해 이번 장에 나오는 TCP 구현은","words":[{"text":"게","x":545,"y":561,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"제공하는지","x":594,"y":561,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":780,"y":561,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"전체","x":945,"y":561,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"내용을","x":1030,"y":560,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"살펴보기","x":1148,"y":561,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"위해","x":1305,"y":561,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"이번","x":1392,"y":562,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"장에","x":1478,"y":563,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"나오는","x":1565,"y":564,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"TCP","x":1688,"y":568,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"구현은","x":1779,"y":567,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"TCP 수신자가 순서가 들린 세그먼트를 버린다고 가정한다.","words":[{"text":"TCP","x":541,"y":624,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"수신자가","x":625,"y":620,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"순서가","x":775,"y":619,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"들린","x":889,"y":620,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":970,"y":620,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"버린다고","x":1156,"y":620,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"가정한다.","x":1308,"y":621,"width":146,"height":38}]},{"text":"TCP는 송신자가 수신 원도우(receive window)라는 변수를 유지하여 흐름제어를","words":[{"text":"TCP는","x":607,"y":682,"width":107,"height":34},{"text":"송신자가","x":726,"y":679,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":876,"y":679,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"원도우(receive","x":959,"y":679,"width":230,"height":38},{"text":"window)라는","x":1202,"y":680,"width":218,"height":38},{"text":"변수를","x":1436,"y":682,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"유지하여","x":1552,"y":683,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"흐름제어를","x":1709,"y":684,"width":164,"height":41}]},{"text":"제공한다. 수신 원도우는 수신 측에서 가용한 버퍼 공간이 얼마나 되는지를 송신자에","words":[{"text":"제공한다.","x":542,"y":738,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":701,"y":739,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"원도우는","x":785,"y":738,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":936,"y":738,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"측에서","x":1019,"y":738,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"가용한","x":1139,"y":738,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼","x":1259,"y":739,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"공간이","x":1343,"y":740,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"얼마나","x":1467,"y":742,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"되는지를","x":1587,"y":743,"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"송신자에","x":1744,"y":743,"width":126,"height":41}]},{"text":"게 알려 주는 데 A卜우된 다. TCP는 전이중(full-duplex)이므로 각 측의 송신자는 별개","words":[{"text":"게","x":542,"y":797,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"알려","x":588,"y":798,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"주는","x":668,"y":799,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"데","x":752,"y":798,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"A卜우된","x":799,"y":798,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"다.","x":916,"y":798,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"TCP는","x":973,"y":801,"width":107,"height":33},{"text":"전이중(full-duplex)이므로","x":1095,"y":798,"width":413,"height":41},{"text":"각","x":1522,"y":801,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"측의","x":1571,"y":802,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"송신자는","x":1657,"y":802,"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"별개","x":1814,"y":803,"width":56,"height":39}]},{"text":"의 수신 원도우를 유지한다. 파일 전송의 환경에서 수신 원도우를 살펴보자. TCP 연결","words":[{"text":"의","x":541,"y":856,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"수신","x":585,"y":856,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"원도우를","x":665,"y":856,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"유지한다.","x":813,"y":857,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":973,"y":858,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"전송의","x":1056,"y":857,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"환경에서","x":1171,"y":858,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1323,"y":859,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"원도우를","x":1409,"y":860,"width":139,"height":36},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":1561,"y":860,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1726,"y":865,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"연결","x":1813,"y":862,"width":57,"height":39}]},{"text":"상에서 호스트 A가 호스트 B에게 큰 파일을 전송한다고 가정할 때, 호스트 B는 이 연","words":[{"text":"상에서","x":539,"y":914,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":653,"y":917,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"A가","x":767,"y":916,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":843,"y":918,"width":103,"height":29},{"text":"B에게","x":959,"y":917,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"큰","x":1068,"y":919,"width":35,"height":33},{"text":"파일을","x":1115,"y":917,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"전송한다고","x":1236,"y":918,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"가정할","x":1425,"y":919,"width":105,"height":36},{"text":"때,","x":1545,"y":919,"width":41,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":1602,"y":921,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"B는","x":1724,"y":922,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":1800,"y":920,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"연","x":1845,"y":925,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"결에 수신 버퍼를 할당한다. 이때 할당된 수신 버퍼의 크기를 RcvBuffer라고 명명","words":[{"text":"결에","x":540,"y":974,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":618,"y":974,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼를","x":702,"y":974,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"할당한다.","x":817,"y":975,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"이때","x":980,"y":976,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"할당된","x":1062,"y":976,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":1180,"y":977,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼의","x":1268,"y":977,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"크기를","x":1386,"y":978,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"RcvBuffer라고","x":1507,"y":979,"width":290,"height":37},{"text":"명명","x":1813,"y":981,"width":55,"height":39}]},{"text":"한다. 시간 나는 대로 호스트 B의 애플리케이션 프로세스는 버퍼로부터 데이터를 읽으","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":538,"y":1035,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"시간","x":627,"y":1034,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"나는","x":707,"y":1034,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"대로","x":788,"y":1034,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":866,"y":1037,"width":103,"height":29},{"text":"B의","x":982,"y":1036,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1056,"y":1036,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1277,"y":1037,"width":177,"height":36},{"text":"버퍼로부터","x":1469,"y":1037,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1659,"y":1039,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"읽으","x":1813,"y":1041,"width":59,"height":36}]},{"text":"며 다음과 같은 변수들을 정의한다.","words":[{"text":"며","x":540,"y":1095,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"다음과","x":584,"y":1094,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"같은","x":697,"y":1094,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"변수들을","x":778,"y":1094,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"정의한다.","x":926,"y":1095,"width":143,"height":38}]},{"text":"• LastByteRead: 호스트 B의 애플리게이션 프로세스에 의해서 버퍼로부터 읽","words":[{"text":"•","x":540,"y":1204,"width":13,"height":14},{"text":"LastByteRead:","x":602,"y":1195,"width":286,"height":35},{"text":"호스트","x":908,"y":1191,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"B의","x":1028,"y":1190,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":1107,"y":1189,"width":208,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1333,"y":1189,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"의해서","x":1528,"y":1191,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼로부터","x":1655,"y":1193,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"읽","x":1845,"y":1197,"width":24,"height":36}]},{"text":"한 데이터 스트림의 마지막 바이트의 수","words":[{"text":"한","x":603,"y":1250,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":648,"y":1250,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"스트림의","x":759,"y":1250,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":908,"y":1251,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"바이트의","x":1024,"y":1250,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1175,"y":1251,"width":36,"height":37}]},{"text":"• LastByteRcvd: 호스트 B에서 네트워크로부터 도착하여 수신 버퍼에 저장된","words":[{"text":"•","x":538,"y":1337,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"LastByteRcvd:","x":601,"y":1330,"width":285,"height":34},{"text":"호스트","x":906,"y":1325,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"B에서","x":1025,"y":1322,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크로부터","x":1140,"y":1321,"width":240,"height":38},{"text":"도착하여","x":1400,"y":1321,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1561,"y":1323,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼에","x":1653,"y":1325,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"저장된","x":1779,"y":1326,"width":92,"height":39}]},{"text":"데이터 스트림의 마지막 바이트의 수","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":601,"y":1384,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"스트림의","x":712,"y":1385,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":860,"y":1384,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"바이트의","x":975,"y":1383,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1125,"y":1383,"width":36,"height":37}]},{"text":"TCP는 할당된 버퍼의 오버플로를 허용하지 않으므로 다음 수식이 기능하다.","words":[{"text":"TCP는","x":530,"y":1491,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"할당된","x":647,"y":1490,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼의","x":762,"y":1490,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"오버플로를","x":873,"y":1489,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"허용하지","x":1060,"y":1488,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"않으므로","x":1212,"y":1487,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"다음","x":1366,"y":1489,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"수식이","x":1448,"y":1489,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"기능하다.","x":1571,"y":1490,"width":154,"height":39}]},{"text":"LastByteRcvd-LastByteReadsRcvBuffer","words":[{"text":"LastByteRcvd-LastByteReadsRcvBuffer","x":528,"y":1590,"width":827,"height":36}]},{"text":"rwnd로 명명된 수신 원도-우는 버퍼의 여유 공간으로 설정된다.","words":[{"text":"rwnd로","x":528,"y":1684,"width":124,"height":29},{"text":"명명된","x":667,"y":1681,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"수신","x":777,"y":1682,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"원도-우는","x":858,"y":1682,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼의","x":1008,"y":1681,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"여유","x":1125,"y":1681,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"공간으로","x":1206,"y":1681,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"설정된다.","x":1362,"y":1682,"width":150,"height":39}]},{"text":"rwnd=RcvBuffer- [LastByteRcvd-LastByteReadJ","words":[{"text":"rwnd=RcvBuffer-","x":527,"y":1783,"width":338,"height":29},{"text":"[LastByteRcvd-LastByteReadJ","x":881,"y":1784,"width":633,"height":37}]},{"text":"시간에 따라 여유 공간은 변하므로 rwnd는 동적이다. 변수 rwnd는 그림 3.38에 도","words":[{"text":"시간에","x":526,"y":1873,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"따라","x":640,"y":1875,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"여유","x":723,"y":1875,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"공간은","x":801,"y":1874,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"변하므로","x":921,"y":1877,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"rwnd는","x":1073,"y":1878,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"동적이다.","x":1217,"y":1876,"width":151,"height":39},{"text":"변수","x":1389,"y":1877,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"rwnd는","x